<title>JAPAN: Ihara High Pressure Fittings to change name.</title>
<headline>Ihara High Pressure Fittings to change name.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ihara High Pressure Fittings Co Ltd said on Thursday it would change its company name to Ihara Science Corp on October 1.</p>
<p>The current name of Ihara High Pressure Fittings does not correctly represent the company's business as it now produces various piping material and offers related services, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
